Dan,  Please organize a meeting next week (ASAP) as follows:

Topic:  		Competitive Markets Planning Meeting

Agenda:	Discuss results and next steps from Accenture study.

		Agree on East Desk Power/IT project focus over the next 6 months.

		Assign IT and East Desk owners for each project.

		Agree on format and content of documentation needed to secure sponsorship.
		(high-level workplans and inception documents - ie... scope, benefit, timeline, resources, etc..)

		Agree on timeframe to complete documentation and present to Lloyd, Kevin, and Sally for approval.

		Discuss Louise and Lavorato approval requirements, if any.

		Discuss post-approval next steps, including staffing options.

Participants:	All individuals on cc list and myself

Time:		2 Hours

Dan,  You will need to speak with most of these individuals directly to determine availability.  Let me know if you have any questions.  Marryott and Poston can join via phone conference.

Thanks,  Steve
		

		
		

