Stacey:

Starting from May 2001, per Chris Foster and Tim Belden's agreement, Chris 
Foster is calculating the origination based on the entire book P&L for the 
month, therefore basically for every deal in certain books. 

For example, he got the origination for May by the formula below:
Mid-Market Origination for May = agreed percentage * (YTD P&L as of May 31, 
2001 - YTD P&L as of April 30, 2001) 

The agreed percentage varies for each book, and for the questioned books they 
are as below:
LT-NW 12%
LT-CA 8%
LT-WMGMT 12%

Please advise how we should proceed to respond to AA.

Thanks,
Fran
