The time frame between 7 and 11 a.m. in AdHoc is irrelevant because once we calc in the afternoon (which "writes" daily info to AdHoc), the AdHoc table should not change until we calc the following afternoon.  You can be sure that you will only capture the previous day's historical data unless IT is doing some sort of testing and it utilizing AdHoc.  This happens very rarely but when it does, we will make sure to keep you in the loop.

